* CA-7 STYLE SCHEDULE FOR THE QUILLMARK BATCH (FICTIONAL)
JOB      SCHID  TRIGGERED-BY          DEPENDS-ON                 CALENDAR
QMKD020  001    CLOSE OF ONLINE DAY   -                          WORKDAYS
